      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Both heterotopic pregnancies and primary neoplasms of the fallopian tube are rare occurrences. A patient presented with early pregnancy, abdominal pain and ultrasound findings of an intrauterine gestation and a fallopian tube mass. Laparotomy revealed a primary leiomyoma of the fallopian tube."},
